	</div><div class="entries" data-archive="default" data-layout="grid" data-cards="boxed"><article class="entry-card card-content post-71449 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-indie-games category-news tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/indie-games/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-62">Indie Games</a>, <a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/official-august-newsletter-for-steams-chaotic-roguelike-elin-has-been-released-little-sister-roids-combine-into-a-giant-little-sister/" rel="bookmark">The official August newsletter for Steam’s chaotic roguelike Elin has been released. Little Sister-roids combine into a giant Little Sister called “Imoutomaton” and attack!</a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/official-august-newsletter-for-steams-chaotic-roguelike-elin-has-been-released-little-sister-roids-combine-into-a-giant-little-sister/" aria-label="The official August newsletter for Steam’s chaotic roguelike Elin has been released. Little Sister-roids combine into a giant Little Sister called “Imoutomaton” and attack!"><img width="768" height="249" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Elindayori_header009_EN-768x249.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Elindayori_header009_EN-768x249.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Elindayori_header009_EN-380x123.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Elindayori_header009_EN-1536x498.jpg 1536w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Elindayori_header009_EN.jpg 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Elin State of the Game – August 202, the 6th edition of Elin's official newsletter.</p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/automaton_en/" title="Posts by AUTOMATON WEST" rel="author"><span>AUTOMATON WEST</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2026-08-27T18:00:00+09:00">2026-08-27 18:00</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-55640 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/needy-streamer-overload-devs-new-supernatural-little-sister-visual-novel-gets-over-10000-steam-wishlists-on-its-first-day/" rel="bookmark">Needy Streamer Overload devs’ new supernatural “little sister” visual novel gets over 10,000 Steam Wishlists on its first day</a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/needy-streamer-overload-devs-new-supernatural-little-sister-visual-novel-gets-over-10000-steam-wishlists-on-its-first-day/" aria-label="Needy Streamer Overload devs’ new supernatural “little sister” visual novel gets over 10,000 Steam Wishlists on its first day"><img width="768" height="432" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260108-55640-header-768x432.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260108-55640-header-768x432.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260108-55640-header-380x214.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260108-55640-header.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Sister Other Paranoia, Naylra's first visual novel under HazeDenkiis set to release in August 2026 on Steam.</p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/carlos-zotomayor/" title="Posts by Carlos &quot;Zoto&quot; Zotomayor" rel="author"><span>Carlos "Zoto" Zotomayor</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2026-01-08T16:25:38+09:00">2026-01-08 16:25</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-68977 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-indie-games category-news tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/indie-games/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-62">Indie Games</a>, <a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/needy-streamer-overload-creators-new-visual-novel-sister-other-paranoia-gets-august-15-launch-date/" rel="bookmark">Needy Streamer Overload creator’s new visual novel Sister Other Paranoia gets August 15 launch date </a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/needy-streamer-overload-creators-new-visual-novel-sister-other-paranoia-gets-august-15-launch-date/" aria-label="Needy Streamer Overload creator’s new visual novel Sister Other Paranoia gets August 15 launch date "><img width="768" height="432" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260127-56179-header-1-768x432.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260127-56179-header-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260127-56179-header-1-380x214.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260127-56179-header-1.jpg 1518w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>nyalra's new game company HazeDenki has announced that the dark visual novel Sister Other Paranoia will launch on August 15.</p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/carlos-zotomayor/" title="Posts by Carlos &quot;Zoto&quot; Zotomayor" rel="author"><span>Carlos "Zoto" Zotomayor</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2026-06-30T13:02:15+09:00">2026-06-30 13:02</time></li><li class="meta-comments"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/needy-streamer-overload-creators-new-visual-novel-sister-other-paranoia-gets-august-15-launch-date/#comments">1 Comment</a></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-68323 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-indie-games category-news tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/indie-games/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-62">Indie Games</a>, <a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/needy-streamer-overload-creators-new-dark-visual-novel-sister-other-paranoia-gets-us-publisher/" rel="bookmark">Needy Streamer Overload creator’s new dark visual novel Sister Other Paranoia gets US publisher </a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/needy-streamer-overload-creators-new-dark-visual-novel-sister-other-paranoia-gets-us-publisher/" aria-label="Needy Streamer Overload creator’s new dark visual novel Sister Other Paranoia gets US publisher "><img width="768" height="431" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260617-68323-header-768x431.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="Sister Other Paranoia" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/