</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/automaton_en/" title="Posts by AUTOMATON WEST" rel="author"><span>AUTOMATON WEST</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2026-04-28T18:00:00+09:00">2026-04-28 18:00</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-65234 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-indie-games category-news tag-indie-games tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/indie-games/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-62">Indie Games</a>, <a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/japanese-idol-streamer-mystery-game-featuring-kikuo-theme-song-reaches-10000-wishlists-in-3-days-english-support-also-announced/" rel="bookmark">Japanese idol streamer mystery game featuring Kikuo theme song reaches 10,000 Wishlists in 3 days. English support also announced</a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/japanese-idol-streamer-mystery-game-featuring-kikuo-theme-song-reaches-10000-wishlists-in-3-days-english-support-also-announced/" aria-label="Japanese idol streamer mystery game featuring Kikuo theme song reaches 10,000 Wishlists in 3 days. English support also announced"><img width="768" height="424" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260414-65234-header-768x424.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260414-65234-header-768x424.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260414-65234-header-380x210.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260414-65234-header.jpg 776w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Red Chat Ritual – TSUMIMI TIME, coming soon on Steam, has reached 10,000 Wishlist in just 3 days since the launch of its store page. </p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/djordje-p/" title="Posts by Đorđe P" rel="author"><span>Đorđe P</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2026-04-14T13:18:30+09:00">2026-04-14 13:18</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-60548 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-indie-games category-news tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/indie-games/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-62">Indie Games</a>, <a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/the-official-february-newsletter-for-steams-chaotic-roguelike-elin-has-been-released/" rel="bookmark">The official February newsletter for Steam&#8217;s chaotic roguelike Elin has been released, packed with more nyan nyan nyans!</a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/the-official-february-newsletter-for-steams-chaotic-roguelike-elin-has-been-released/" aria-label="The official February newsletter for Steam&#8217;s chaotic roguelike Elin has been released, packed with more nyan nyan nyans!"><img width="768" height="247" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20260225-60548-header-768x247.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20260225-60548-header-768x247.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20260225-60548-header-380x122.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20260225-60548-header-1536x495.jpg 1536w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20260225-60548-header.jpg 1589w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Elin State of the Game – February 2026, the third edition of Elin's official newsletter.</p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/automaton_en/" title="Posts by AUTOMATON WEST" rel="author"><span>AUTOMATON WEST</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2026-02-26T18:15:00+09:00">2026-02-26 18:15</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-55686 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-interviews tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/interviews/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-10">Interviews</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/interviews/after-nearly-20-years-of-game-development-the-seeds-i-planted-have-finally-sprouted-solo-dev-behind-sandbox-rpg-elona-talks-about-success-of-sequel-eli/" rel="bookmark">“After nearly 20 years of game development, the seeds I planted have finally sprouted.” Solo dev behind sandbox RPG Elona talks about success of sequel Elin </a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/interviews/after-nearly-20-years-of-game-development-the-seeds-i-planted-have-finally-sprouted-solo-dev-behind-sandbox-rpg-elona-talks-about-success-of-sequel-eli/" aria-label="“After nearly 20 years of game development, the seeds I planted have finally sprouted.” Solo dev behind sandbox RPG Elona talks about success of sequel Elin "><img width="768" height="414" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260110-55686-header-768x414.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="Elin" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260110-55686-header-768x414.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260110-55686-header-380x205.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260110-55686-header-1536x828.jpg 1536w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260110-55686-header.jpg 1756w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Noa, the solo developer behind hit Japanese sandbox RPGs Elona and Elin, talks about what has made the sequel so successful.</p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/automaton_en/" title="Posts by AUTOMATON WEST" rel="author"><span>AUTOMATON WEST</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2026-01-13T17:00:00+09:00">2026-01-13 17:00</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-54585 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news category-nongaming-news tag-japan-related-news tag-non-gaming-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a>, <a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/nongaming-news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-65">Non-Gaming News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/look-back-live-action-remake-blows-away-all-concerns-of-another-bad-adaptation-after-the-filmmaker-behind-it-is-revealed-gets-tatsuki-fujimotos-seal-of-approval/" rel="bookmark">Look Back live-action remake blows away all concerns of “another bad adaptation” after the filmmaker behind it is revealed, gets Tatsuki Fujimoto’s seal of approval</a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/look-back-live-action-remake-blows-away-all-concerns-of-another-bad-adaptation-after-the-filmmaker-behind-it-is-revealed-gets-tatsuki-fujimotos-seal-of-approval/" aria-label="Look Back live-action remake blows away all concerns of “another bad adaptation” after the filmmaker behind it is revealed, gets Tatsuki Fujimoto’s seal of approval"><img width="768" height="343" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/20251204-54585-header-768x343.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/20251204-54585-header-768x343.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/20251204-54585-header-380x170.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/20251204-54585-header.jpg 1450w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>It was recently revealed that a new live-action adaptation of Look Back will be directed by award-winning filmmaker Hirokazu Kore-eda.</p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/djordje-p/" title="Posts by Đorđe P" rel="author"><span>Đorđe P</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2025-12-04T22:00:00+09:00">2025-12-04 22:00</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-26195 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/20240125-26195/" rel="bookmark">This cozy Japanese cafe simulator is full of cute cat girls and ASMR sounds </a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/20240125-26195/" aria-label="This cozy Japanese cafe simulator is full of cute cat girls and ASMR sounds "><img width="768" height="432" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/20240125-26195-header-768x432.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="Kemono Teatime gameplay" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/20240125-26195-header-768x432.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/20240125-26195-header-380x214.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/20240125-26195-header-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/20240125-26195-header-600x338.jpg 600w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/20240125-26195-header.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Kemono Teatime is an upcoming Japanese cafe simulation game that features various kemonomimi (animal-featured) characters, ASMR sounds and cute pixel art.</p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/keiichi-yokoyama/" title="Posts by Keiichi Yokoyama" rel="author"><span>Keiichi Yokoyama</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2024-01-25T18:13:34+09:00">2024-01-25 18:13</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-15515 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-indie-games category-news tag-indie-games" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/indie-games/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-62">Indie Games</a>, <a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/20220908-15515/" rel="bookmark">It was a human is a new psychedelic sci-fi interrogation visual novel</a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/20220908-15515/" aria-label="It was a human is a new psychedelic sci-fi interrogation visual novel"><img width="768" height="432" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-768x432.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-768x432.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-600x338.jpg 600w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-380x214.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-150x84.jpg 150w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-300x169.jpg 300w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-696x392.jpg 696w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-1068x601.jpg 1068w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001-747x420.jpg 747w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/20220907-217918-001.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>It was a human is a short psychedelic sci-fi interrogation visual novel being developed by LOSER/S where the player must question a suspect in a mutilation murder case. The protagonist is tasked with interrogating the suspect, questioning her about her motive and the methods used to carry out the crime. </p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/keiichi-yokoyama/" title="Posts by Keiichi Yokoyama" rel="author"><span>Keiichi Yokoyama</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2022-09-08T13:30:25+09:00">2022-09-08 13:30</time></li></ul></article><article class="entry-card card-content post-11941 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news tag-japan-related-news" ><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_1" ><li class="meta-categories" data-type="simple"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/" rel="tag" class="ct-term-3">News</a></li></ul><h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/20220426-11941/" rel="bookmark">Monochrome Mobius: Rights and Wrongs Forgotten is coming to Steam October 20 [UPDATE]</a></h2><a class="ct-media-container boundless-image" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/news/20220426-11941/" aria-label="Monochrome Mobius: Rights and Wrongs Forgotten is coming to Steam October 20 [UPDATE]"><img width="768" height="432" src="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-768x432.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-768x432.jpg 768w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-600x338.jpg 600w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-380x214.jpg 380w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-150x84.jpg 150w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-300x169.jpg 300w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-696x392.jpg 696w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-1068x601.jpg 1068w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001-747x420.jpg 747w, https://automaton-media.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/20220426-200456-001.jpg 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;" /></a><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Monochrome Mobius: Rights and Wrongs Forgotten, a new JRPG being developed by Aquaplus to commemorate the 20th anniversary of the Utawarerumono series, is coming to Steam on October 20.</p>
</div><ul class="entry-meta" data-type="simple:slash" data-id="meta_2" ><li class="meta-author"><a class="ct-meta-element-author" href="https://automaton-media.com/en/author/keiichi-yokoyama/" title="Posts by Keiichi Yokoyama" rel="author"><span>Keiichi Yokoyama</span></a></li><li class="meta-date" ><time class="ct-meta-element-date" datetime="2022-07-29T14:12:03+09:00">2022-07-29 14:12</time></li></ul></article></div>
